<title>UK: Reuters yr pre-tax profit rises 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Reuters yr pre-tax profit rises 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		30.4		   vs 25.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.0		    vs 7.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 11.75		  vs 9.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     701		    vs 599</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.91 billion	 vs 2.70 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 686 and 703 million stg.</p>
